make walls."], [705.3, "s", "He stacked portions of bananas to make walls."], [708.9, "s", "He stacked portions of bananas to make walls."], [720.2, "s", "He stacked portions of bananas to make walls."], [722.7, "s", "Very good."], [723.6, "s", "He didn't draw a diagram."], [729.0, "s", "He didn't draw a diagram."], [734.3, "s", "Good."], [735.1, "s", "He made it intuitively."], [739.9, "s", "He made it intuitively."], [746.0, "s", "The house was non-linear."], [751.8, "s", "The house was non-linear."], [754.3, "s", "Quinn collaborated with 50 monkeys."], [765.2, "s", "Quinn collaborated with 50 monkeys."], [772.0, "s", "They generated a lot of noise."], [777.6, "s", "They generated a lot of noise."], [784.9, "s", "The monkey did not agree with what Quinn said."], [788.4, "s", "So the monkey said, that's a matter of semantics."], [795.4, "s", "That's a matter of semantics good."], [801.4, "s", "That's a matter of semantics."], [803.5, "s", "Very nice."], [804.4, "s", "Listen again one more time, or three more times, or a hundred more times, whatever."], [810.8, "s", "And then pause, stop, and try to tell all of the story yourself, from the beginning to the end."], [818.8, "s", "You don't need to remember every word or every sentence; remember the general ideas."], [824.8, "s", "Try to use the vocabulary."], [827.0, "s", "Okay?"], [827.7, "s", "Good job."], [828.5, "s", "See you next time."], [829.6, "s", "Bye-bye."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
