came fatigued."], [561.9, "s", "Even though he was fatigued, he did not have a failure of nerve."], [566.5, "s", "He did not become afraid."], [567.9, "s", "He said, I will not have a failure of nerve."], [571.2, "s", "I will overcome every problem."], [573.5, "s", "I will beat every problem."], [575.2, "s", "I will overcome every catastrophe."], [577.7, "s", "I will overcome every disaster."], [579.9, "s", "I will persist."], [581.5, "s", "I will keep trying until I find her."], [584.5, "s", "I will never quit."], [585.6, "s", "I will persist."], [587.2, "s", "One day, the frog came to a large, tumultuous river."], [591.0, "s", "It was not a calm river."], [592.4, "s", "It was not a small river."], [593.9, "s", "It was a tumultuous river, churning and moving very fast."], [598.7, "s", "It had huge rocks and waves."], [600.4, "s", "It was a tumultuous river."], [602.4, "s", "And he felt so much fatigue."], [605.3, "s", "He didn't have the capacity to cross the river."], [607.8, "s", "He was not strong enough anymore."], [609.6, "q", "He didn't have the capacity to swim across, so he yelled to a turtle, Can you help me cross the river?"], [615.9, "a", "The turtle said, why do you want to cross?"], [619.4, "s", "And the frog said, I must find my princess."], [623.0, "s", "He was still obsessed."], [625.1, "s", "The turtle was surprised."], [627.1, "s", "Are you implying that you want to marry a human?"], [630.4, "q", "Are you suggesting you want to marry a human?"], [633.8, "a", "Yes, the frog said, still obsessed."], [638.0, "s", "The frog got on the turtle's back."], [639.6, "s", "But he was a small turtle, and his back was wet."], [643.9, "s", "The frog's position was not good."], [645.9, "s", "It was a tenuous position."], [647.6, "s", "He could easily fall off."], [649.8, "s", "He almost fell several times, but finally, they got to the other side."], [655.8, "s", "On the other side, he saw a beautiful woman."], [658.2, "s", "It was his princess."], [660.2, "s", "He jumped into her arms and kissed her."], [663.7, "s", "She became a frog and a frog princess for him."], [671.4, "s", "They kissed again."], [672.9, "s", "They got married."], [674.6, "s", "The end."], [676.1, "s", "Okay, listen to this a couple times."], [677.8, "s", "It will help you remember some of these key vocabulary words, these important vocabulary words."], [684.8, "s", "And as usual, review the text, review the learning guide, listen a few times to everything."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
