eep into the living room?"], [467.7, "a", "No."], [468.9, "s", "She didn't need to creep into the living room."], [471.6, "q", "Where did she need to creep into?"], [476.8, "a", "Well, she needed to creep into the kitchen, right?"], [479.2, "s", "Go quietly, secretly into the kitchen."], [482.1, "s", "And so she crept past tense."], [484.5, "s", "She crept into the kitchen."], [487.1, "s", "She saw a plate of big stinky fish, smelly fish, in an open cabinet."], [493.8, "s", "But then Enu the dog saw her."], [496.0, "s", "The dog barked, roof, and ran towards her."], [500.7, "s", "Nickel ran too."], [502.0, "s", "She jumped up, and then she heaved herself into the cabinet."], [506.8, "q", "Did she throw herself into the cabinet?"], [510.7, "a", "Yes, she did."], [511.8, "s", "She threw herself into the cabinet."], [513.8, "s", "She heaved herself into the cabinet."], [517.0, "q", "Did she heave a rock into the cabinet?"], [522.0, "a", "No, she didn't heave a rock into a cabinet."], [525.4, "s", "She heaved herself into a cabinet."], [528.6, "q", "Did she heave herself into the dishwasher?"], [533.6, "a", "Well, no, no."], [535.0, "s", "She didn't heave herself into the dishwasher."], [536.4, "q", "After she heaved herself into the cabinet, where did she heave herself?"], [543.6, "a", "She heaved herself into the cabinet."], [548.3, "s", "And she made it."], [549.7, "s", "She was successful."], [551.1, "s", "She jumped into the cabinet."], [552.4, "s", "She heaved herself into the cabinet."], [554.4, "s", "And the dog could not catch her."], [557.4, "s", "When she knew she was safe, Nicole Chan smiled."], [562.1, "s", "And then she delved into the plate of fish."], [566.1, "q", "Did she eat carefully?"], [570.6, "a", "No, she didn't eat carefully."], [572.5, "s", "She delved into the plate of fish."], [575.0, "s", "She went into the plate of fish very deep."], [578.2, "s", "Both paws, both hands, grabbing all the fish."], [581.6, "s", "She delved into the fish."], [584.2, "q", "Did she delve into a chocolate cake?"], [589.4, "a", "No, she didn't delve into a chocolate cake."], [592.4, "s", "Did she delve into an apple pie?"], [596.4, "q", "No?"], [597.8, "a", "She didn't delve into an apple pie."], [600.3, "q", "Did she delve into studying English?"], [604.5, "a", "No, definitely not."], [606.2, "s", "She already speaks English."], [607.7, "s", "She did not delve into studying English."], [610.6, "q", "What did she delve into?"], [613.7, "a", "Well, Neko delved into the plate of fish."], [618.1, "s", "In fact, she ate all of the fish and she ate 15 kilos of fish."], [623.7, "s", "15 kilos of fish."], [625.0, "s", "She delved into all of it."], [626.7, "s", "She ate it all."], [629.4, "s", "Okay, one more time."], [631.4, "s", "I'm going to repeat all of it."], [633.3, "s", "But I'm going to pause after some phrases, and I want you just to repeat the phrase, okay?"], [638.2, "s", "So I'll say a phrase, for example, butterflies in her stomach."], [642.9, "s", "Then I will pause and wait."], [644.8, "s", "You should copy my phrase."], [646.3, "s", "You should say, butterflies in her stomach."], [649.7, "s", "And then I'll repeat it again."], [650.9, "s", "Try to copy my pronunciation, my tone and my rhythm, everything."], [658.1, "s", "Niko-chan had butterflies in her stomach."], [666.0, "s", "Niko-chan had butterflies in her stomach."], [674.0, "s", "She tried to calm down."], [676.1, "s", "She wanted to feel centered."], [681.5, "s", "She wanted to feel centered."], [686.2, "s", "But she couldn't calm down."], [689.4, "s", "A large dog, Inu, was guarding the kitchen."], [692.3, "s", "A large dog, Inu, was guarding the kitchen."], [701.3, "s", "Neko could smell the food."], [703.6, "s", "She tried to be dispassionate, but the smell made her hungry."], [709.6, "s", "She tried to be dispassionate."], [715.0, "s", "She tried to be dispassionate."], [720.8, "s", "It felt like something was searing her stomach."], [728.4, "s", "It felt like something was searing her stomach."], [735.9, "s", "She knew she couldn't coerce the dog."], [743.0, "s", "She knew she couldn't coerce the dog."], [749.8, "s", "She had to creep into the kitchen."], [755.5, "s", "She had to creep into the kitchen."], [760.4, "s", "And so she crept."], [765.2, "s", "And so she crept."], [770.5, "s", "She saw a plate of stinky fish and then the dog saw her and barked rough."], [775.8, "s", "The dog ran towards her and Nikko ran towards the cabinet with the fish."], [783.3, "s", "Then she heaved herself into the cabinet."], [790.8, "s", "Then she heaved herself into the cabinet."], [799.1, "s", "When she knew she was safe, she smiled and she delved into the plate of fish."], [808.6, "s", "She delved into the plate of fish."], [814.7, "s", "She delved into the plate of fish."], [820.1, "s", "Okay, she ate it all, and she got fat."], [823.4, "s", "Alright, now finally, one more thing."], [825.5, "s", "I want you to stop."], [826.6, "s", "I want you to pause this, and I want you to tell all of the story yourself."], [831.8, "s", "Say it out loud so you can hear it with your own ears."], [835.2, "s", "Tell this entire story, all of the story, and use the new vocabulary."], [840.8, "s", "If you can't remember every word, no problem."], [843.8, "s", "It's okay."], [844.5, "s", "This is not a memory test."], [846.5, "s", "I just want you to remember the key vocabulary."], [848.6, "s", "So, try to tell the general story and try to use the vocabulary."], [853.1, "s", "If you have a lot of problems."], [855.4, "s", "Just relax."], [856.6, "s", "Listen again, listen ten times, listen one hundred times, it doesn't matter."], [861.1, "s", "Listen often and then try to tell it yourself."], [864.5, "s", "Okay, that's all."], [865.8, "s", "See you next time."], [866.8, "s", "Bye-bye."]]}]$j$::jsonb,
