ach."], [445.6, "s", "It's bleeding inside his stomach."], [447.5, "s", "It's a very serious injury."], [449.9, "s", "He's hurt very badly."], [451.8, "s", "So he has a hemorrhage in his stomach."], [455.0, "q", "What happens next?"], [455.9, "a", "Well, the police come."], [457.9, "s", "They take him to the hospital."], [459.7, "q", "Why do they take him to the hospital?"], [462.1, "a", "Well, they take him because he has a hemorrhage in his stomach."], [466.3, "s", "It's very serious."], [469.1, "s", "Sally's punch was a seminal event in Andy's life."], [472.7, "q", "Was it a small event?"], [475.0, "a", "No, it's a seminal event."], [477.8, "s", "It's a very important event."], [479.6, "s", "It's a very original, special event."], [482.3, "s", "Because it created a new life for him in the future."], [487.1, "s", "Because of this happening, because of this experience."], [490.5, "s", "So this event was a seminal event."], [492.6, "s", "It was an original event."], [493.8, "s", "It was a seminal event, a special event."], [496.1, "s", "A seminal event, a special event in his life."], [499.5, "s", "Because he almost died."], [502.2, "s", "Since he almost died, he started to think about his life a lot."], [505.8, "s", "He realized, oh my god, I need to change my life."], [508.8, "s", "I almost died and I'm living a terrible life, I'm marginalized and I'm homeless."], [514.5, "s", "I need to change."], [516.0, "s", "So when he gets out of the hospital, he finds a job."], [519.4, "s", "He goes to night school."], [521.3, "s", "Eventually he becomes very successful."], [524.5, "s", "And now he's happy that Sally punched him."], [527.5, "s", "Why is he happy that he got punched?"], [529.8, "q", "Why is he happy he had a hemorrhage?"], [532.1, "a", "Well, because the punch and the hemorrhage, they were the catalyst for changing his life."], [539.9, "s", "They caused him to change his life."], [542.7, "s", "They started the change."], [545.1, "s", "So they were the catalyst."], [546.8, "s", "These events were the catalyst."], [548.5, "s", "The catalyst starts a reaction."], [550.9, "s", "It starts a change."], [552.3, "s", "So this catalyst helped to change his life."], [556.9, "s", "Okay, now one more time."], [558.3, "s", "This time I'm going to just repeat some of the phrases or sentences and then I'll pause and then you repeat after me."], [567.0, "s", "And then I'll say it again and then you say it again."], [570.3, "s", "Okay, here we go."], [572.2, "s", "Andy is a marginalized man."], [577.9, "s", "Andy is a marginalized man."], [585.0, "s", "He's too spontaneous."], [590.4, "s", "He's too spontaneous."], [592.4, "s", "Sally has physical prowess."], [604.1, "s", "Sally has physical prowess."], [611.3, "s", "Andy tentatively approaches Sally."], [618.6, "s", "Andy tentatively approaches Sally."], [626.6, "s", "Andy's job didn't pan out."], [633.4, "s", "Andy's job didn't pan out."], [640.0, "s", "He tells her a confessional story."], [643.1, "s", "He tells her a confessional story."], [655.6, "s", "Andy had a hemorrhage."], [660.9, "s", "Andy had a hemorrhage."], [667.7, "s", "It was a seminal event in his life."], [675.0, "s", "It was a seminal event in his life."], [685.7, "s", "The punch was the catalyst for change."], [689.5, "s", "The punch was the catalyst for change."], [701.5, "s", "Okay, now one more time, I'm going to repeat only the new vocabulary words."], [706.7, "s", "So please repeat the vocabulary words after me."], [710.8, "s", "Copy my pronunciation."], [713.7, "s", "Okay, here we go."], [719.9, "s", "Marginalized, spontaneous, prowess, tentatively."], [751.2, "s", "Pan out, pan out, didn't pan out, didn't pan out."], [765.6, "s", "Confessional, hemorrhage, seminal, catalyst."], [795.4, "s", "Okay, that is all for the mini-story lesson."], [799.7, "s", "Please repeat this lesson a few times, even if you understand everything, even if you know the vocabulary."], [807.5, "s", "Repeating will help you learn it au